### ==============================================================================
### PUBLIC TRUST & CREDENTIAL VERIFICATION APIS (Scan QR Code Endpoints)
### Open to the general public, law enforcement, and donors without login
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Verify Member ID Card (QR code on physical or digital ID card scans here)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify/member/BYK-MEM-2026-1001

### 2. Verify Certificate of Recognition / Appreciation
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify/certificate/BYK-CERT-2026-0001

### 3. Verify Section 80G Tax Exemption Donation Receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify/donation/BYK-80G-2026-0001
